{"id":"00211","root":"uni00211_1","name":{"ja":"由利　翡翠","en":"Yuri Hisui"},"title":{"ja":"【浜辺の翠玉】","en":"【Emerald Gale】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【浜辺の翠玉】 由利　翡翠","en":"【Emerald Gale】 Yuri Hisui"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-06-30","limited":true,"characterId":32,"profile":{"ja":"主に前線での戦闘任務にあたる対魔忍。任務以外ではボーッとしていて、訓練などでも目立つことはない。だが、いざ戦闘となると忍法の特性を生かし、驚くほど執念深い戦いを見せる。そのギャップと口下手な性格からか、親しく付き合う友人などもおらず、基本的には一人で居る事が多い。ただ、本人は決して人嫌いなわけではなく、仲間意識も強いタイプで、仲間を傷つける者には一切の容赦を見せない。普段は非常に質素な生活を送っていて趣味もこれといってないが、餌付けした野鳥と戯れるのを日課としている。海外のリゾート地で、政府高官と闇組織の人間が会合を行うという情報がもたらされ、現場を抑える任務についた翡翠。だが、その潜入のために買った水着は随分と大胆なものだった。水着のデザインなどに興味もなく、相談をする相手もいない為に、店員に勧められるままに買ってしまったのだ。彼女はビーチの視線を一心に集めるが、もともと人目は気にしない翡翠は、彼女なりにビーチを楽しんでいる振りをするのだった。","en":"Yuri Hisui serves primarily on the front lines as a Taimanin. Outside of missions she tends to space out and doesn't stand out even during training. Yet when combat erupts, she leverages the traits of her ninjutsu to fight with astonishing tenacity. Because of this gap and her taciturn nature, she has no close friends and usually spends time alone. That said, she isn't antisocial and feels a strong sense of camaraderie, showing no mercy to anyone who harms her comrades. She lives a very modest life and has no particular hobbies, though she makes it a daily routine to play with the wild birds she feeds. When intelligence revealed that a government official and a shadow-organization operative would meet at an overseas resort, Yuri was assigned to secure the site. The swimsuit she bought for the infiltration was extremely daring, but she had no interest in its design and no one to consult, so she purchased it on the sales clerk's recommendation. She draws every gaze on the beach, yet Yuri, who never worries about being watched, simply pretends to enjoy the beach in her own way."},"illustrator":"柄あゆり","voiceActor":"疾風はる","forms":[{"id":"uni00211_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats"